  "code": "1436",
  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"1010\">\n<p data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"1010\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"903\">Microarray (60K)</strong> detects copy number variations (microdeletions, microduplications) across the genome with high resolution.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1128\">\n<p data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1128\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1026\">Karyotype</strong> detects large chromosomal abnormalities, aneuploidies, translocations, and structural rearrangements.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1310\">\n<p data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1310\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Combined approach improves diagnostic yield in developmental delay, intellectual disability, autism spectrum disorder, multiple congenital anomalies, and recurrent pregnancy loss.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1387\">\n<p data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1387\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1330\">Normal result</strong> suggests no detectable pathogenic chromosomal imbalance.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1464\">\n<p data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1464\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Abnormal findings may require <strong data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1442\">genetic counseling</strong> and parental studies.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
